# The server image is built from the repo root, and that root holds gigabytes
# the build must never upload: every `target/`, and on a development machine
# the worktrees themselves under .claude/. So this is an allow-list: what cargo
# needs to build the workspace, and nothing else.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!tools/icons/
# The Chromium pin: `scorsese-providers` reads it at compile time, and the
# image's `chromium` stage fetches the build it names (#778).
!tools/chromium/
**/target/
